  "final_message": "The test suite is running in the background. I'll check on the results shortly.\nI have initiated the test execution and will report once it completes.\nI am running the type check and will follow up with the architecture rule verification.\nI am waiting for `npm run typecheck` to finish.\nI have triggered `npm run arch` and will report the result once the command completes.\nI am reviewing the git diff to verify all changes.\nThe [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w3/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L38) event definition and builder function have been updated in compliance with **ARCH-4** (*\"changes are additive; renames and removals go through deprecation\"*):\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n1. **Additive Field Introduction with Deprecation** ([`src/core/events.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w3/r/src/core/events.ts)):\n   - Added `amountCents` and `createdAt` to [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w3/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L38) to align with Payments and Customer APIs.\n   - Retained and marked `totalCents` and `placedAt` with `@deprecated` annotations so external consumers (`billing-service`, `analytics-ingest`) continue to function without breaking.\n   - Updated [`orderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w3/r/src/core/events.ts#L52-L73) to populate both the new (`amountCents`, `createdAt`) and deprecated (`totalCents`, `placedAt`) fields.\n\n2. **Test Updates**:\n   - Updated [`test/app.test.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w3/r/test/app.test.ts) to verify `amountCents` and `createdAt` on published `OrderPlaced` events alongside existing fields.\n   - Updated [`test/adapters.test.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w3/r/test/adapters.test.ts) to verify Kafka-buffered payloads include both `amountCents`/`createdAt` and `totalCents`/`placedAt`.\n\n### Verification\n\n- `npm run typecheck` passed cleanly.\n- `npm run arch` verified no architectural violations.\n- `npm test` passed all 39 tests.\n",
